From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] JavaScriptCore: restore the ARMv7 LLInt and offlineasm
 backend

Upstream removed the 32-bit interpreter paths and the ARMv7 offlineasm
backend. This puts back LowLevelInterpreter32_64.asm, the ARMv7 arms of the
shared interpreter files, the 32-bit offlineasm dialect, the ARM PC base, the
32-bit call frame alignment slot, and the callee-save handling: the VM's
callee saves are saved on entry again, both saved registers are popped when
the interpreter hands a frame to the JIT, and the put_by_id slow path no longer
takes the CodeBlock lock twice.
---
